{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453780/extras/fca597d02e3ee51e2494ef7063f2e21f.avif?t=1769078751\" width=1560 height=299 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Six years ago, the phantom thief \u201c<strong><i>Raven</i></strong>\u201d vanished. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To uncover their true identity, Elaine sets out to investigate the cases Beneatha left behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, in the midst of her investigation, sudden <strong>murder cases</strong> begin to occur one after another...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014What connection lies hidden between the thief\u2019s past and the murders unfolding before her eyes?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453780/extras/d67254ea5125d12f8e5ef2081774a49d.avif?t=1769078751\" width=1560 height=299 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as rookie detective Elaine, travelling across the cities of a small European country at the end of the 19th century together with your partners in pursuit of the phantom thief\u2019s trail.<br>While delving into Beneatha\u2019s past crimes, you must also solve the murder cases happening in the present, gradually drawing closer to the truth lurking behind it all...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search crime scenes, question witnesses, piece together clues, and point out the real culprit!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453780/extras/c683715b504d23d7bdc5905624b0365c.poster.avif?t=1769078751\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453780/extras/c683715b